SUMMARY:SPECIAL EVENT (Must Be Registered): MUSIC & FILM FESTIVAL EVENT
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's BIGGEST Language Exchange Social Event + Class\n**\\
 #\\#\\# ⚠️ If this event is listed as full\\\, you may join the waitli
 st\\. We will let guests in based on available space\\!**\n\n**You must be
