  FREE entry to this event. **You cannot attend the event if you are still 
 on the waitlist by this Thursday Sept. 10. You must be on the attending li
 st on the actual event day to attend.**\n\nDress Code: Semi-formal/busines
 s. **Please dress appropriately for this event.**\n\nWe are having a Speci
 al TILE Music Event during the Toronto International Film Festival at the 
 Revery Hotel from 6- 10 pm on Thursday Sept. 10 2026.\n\nThere is therefor
 e **NO** ESL English X Korean class at Café Princess this week. Our regul
 ar weekly ESL English X Korean classes will continue next week at Café pr
 incess on Wednesday Sept. 16 and continue every Wednesday onwards.\n\n**\\
